    "description": "Vendored baseline LLM model catalogue: the full capability matrix and exact per-MTok costs for every closed-catalogue model. pricing_tier is NEVER stored here -- it is derived from cost at load by ProviderCapability.__post_init__ / derive_pricing_tier. chat=true / embeddings=false are LLM-surface invariants applied by the loader, not stored per row.",
